# local env files
# Every .env variant, not just *.local. This app will hold a Supabase URL and
# anon key once the client is wired in, and the difference between `.env.local`
# and `.env` should not be the thing standing between a key and a public repo.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders
/ios
/android
